"""The MCP tools: one module per tool or small group (brief, get, create, update, complete and confirm, sessions, message, route, anchors, rules), the words they share (text.py) and the helpers more than one of them calls (notes.py). Each tool module exposes `register(mcp, ...)`, which adds its tools to the server's FastMCP instance; web/app.py calls them in the order the tools are listed. The server's own functions a tool calls are handed to `register` as late-bound callables, since these modules never import server.py."""
